    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > BURN AND FALLOW.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VITRIOL is a physics based VR movement shooter. Combining speed and visceral combat with the presence and physicality VR can only offer through stylized physics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and Loose - Long strides and Heavy Blows churn through the wretched horde with a freedom and ease rare to VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand to Skull - Physics based Enemies and an in-depth elbow estimation system provide a physicality and presence to the combat which enhances gameplay beyond what was previously possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood, Fire and Pillars of Smoke - Sinners malformed, Righteous Risen. The Wrath of God in Steeled Men. Scored by a soundtrack that hits just as hard, drowned in a haze just as thick.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > BURN AND FALLOW.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VITRIOL is a physics based VR movement shooter. Combining speed and visceral combat with the presence and physicality VR can only offer through stylized physics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and Loose - Long strides and Heavy Blows churn through the wretched horde with a freedom and ease rare to VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand to Skull - Physics based Enemies and an in-depth elbow estimation system provide a physicality and presence to the combat which enhances gameplay beyond what was previously possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood, Fire and Pillars of Smoke - Sinners malformed, Righteous Risen. The Wrath of God in Steeled Men. Scored by a soundtrack that hits just as hard, drowned in a haze just as thick.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
